            "description": {
              "value": "After your initial attack redirects your foe's defenses, your follow-up wrests their weapon from their grasp. Make a melee Strike with a one-handed melee weapon. In addition to its other effects, this Strike gains the success and critical success effects of the Disarm action. The Strike also has the following failure effect.\n\n- **Failure:** The target is off-guard until the end of your current turn."
